  click K_STATE href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/SessionCoordinator.swift#L485" "App Group group.com.deblaser.nudge, key activeSessionState. Written only by the app (publishSessionState). The widget extension reads it and can only remove it." _blank
  click P_FETCH href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/NudgeWidget/NudgeWidget.swift#L583" "NudgeTaskProvider.fetchTimelineState(), run by getTimeline and getSnapshot. Reads isActive, isPaused, pausedTimeRemaining, timerEndDate, currentTaskID. When isActive is true, not paused, and timerEndDate has passed, it removes the key and treats the session as inactive (L598). While a session is active the next timeline refresh is set to the end instant (L674)." _blank
  click P_ENTRY href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/NudgeWidget/NudgeWidget.swift#L650" "NudgeTaskEntry: isSessionActive, isSessionPaused, sessionTimerEndDate, sessionPausedRemaining, activeTaskID." _blank
  click V_ROW href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/NudgeWidget/NudgeWidget.swift#L1079" "WidgetTaskRow. The row whose task is the session's shows a bolt and a countdown to sessionTimerEndDate. Its checkbox is Button(intent: CompleteTaskIntent(taskID:))." _blank
  click V_FOOT href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/NudgeWidget/NudgeWidget.swift#L975" "sessionButtonRow. Active: a countdown plus a pause capsule and a stop capsule. Inactive: Start Session. All three are plain Links to nudge://focus-session, so none of them starts, pauses or ends anything." _blank
  click I_COMPLETE href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/NudgeWidget/CompleteTaskIntent.swift#L29" "CompleteTaskIntent.perform(). Marks the task complete in SwiftData. If activeSessionState names this task it removes the key (L82). It does not touch ActivityKit. Also cancels the task's pending nudges, sets nudge.arb.widgetMutated, reloads the timeline and posts the unobserved Darwin notification." _blank
  click AK_CTX href "https://developer.apple.com/documentation/widgetkit/activityviewcontext" "context.state (taskName, sessionState, timerEnd, nextTaskName), context.attributes (userName, totalTasksToday, currentTaskIndex) and context.isStale, which turns true at the staleDate the app set." _blank
  click V_LA href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/NudgeWidget/TaskLiveActivityView.swift#L352" "TaskLiveActivityView, the only Live Activity in NudgeWidgetBundle. displayState maps a stale .active or .stayFocusedAlert to .timeUp. A tap anywhere opens nudge://focus-session (widgetURL). Dismiss is drawn only in .timeUp." _blank
  click I_STOP href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/NudgeWidget/FocusSessionIntents.swift#L35" "EndFocusSessionIntent.perform(), widget target. Ends every activity with no final content and .immediate dismissal, removes the key, reloads the timeline, posts the unobserved Darwin notification." _blank
  click AK_STOP href "https://developer.apple.com/documentation/activitykit/activity" "activity.end(nil, dismissalPolicy: .immediate) at NudgeWidget/FocusSessionIntents.swift L38." _blank
  click W_RELOAD href "https://developer.apple.com/documentation/widgetkit/widgetcenter" "WidgetCenter.shared.reloadTimelines(ofKind: NudgeTaskWidget). WidgetKit then calls NudgeTaskProvider.getTimeline. The app calls the same thing from publishSessionState." _blank
  click A_URL href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/ContentView.swift#L68" "onOpenURL. nudge://focus-session parses to DeepLink.focusSession and only sets deepLinkTab = .tasks. Opening the app makes the scene active, which runs syncIfActivityDismissed." _blank
  click A_SYNC href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/SessionCoordinator.swift#L233" "The app learns what the widget did only here, by reading the key and Activity.activities on its next launch or scene-active." _blank
